<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $207 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $207 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Thursday it placed $207 million in overnight repurchase agreements at nine percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, overnight call money rose to 6.45 percent from 6.36 percent Wednesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar was unchanged at 0.99983 pesos from the close Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0652</p>
